# Clicks in the .spun GUI: the search field, the category picker and the buttons.
# mame-click.sh fills in @SPUN@ and @PORT@; gui-test.py expands the @ lines (see
# its header): @GOTO moves the pointer to a pixel position, @CLICK presses and
# releases the left button, and the pointer dumps that @GOTO makes are checked
# at the end. The pointer starts at 160,128, on entry 12 of the list (row 16).
# A key press hides the pointer until the mouse moves, and a click while it is
# hidden does not count in the search field.
# The commands the GUI sends are in the proxy's log, which mame-click.sh compares.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
autostart .spun -p @PORT@
autostart PAUSE 0
autostart .ls /dot/SPUN
autostart PRINT "SPUNGUIDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 92
noreset 7.5
mouse 2 move 128 128

@ROWS 15.5 SPLIST 1
@POINTER 15.5 160 128

# 1. Key S and some text hide the pointer. A click with the mouse still: nothing
# happens, the field stays open with its text, and nothing is sent
key 16.5 s
key 17.5 zebra
@TEXT 19 27 1 0 Search:
@TEXT 19 27 9 4 zebra
snap 19
@CLICK 19.5
@TEXT 22 27 1 0 Search:
@TEXT 22 27 9 4 zebra
@ROWS 22 SPLIST 1
@POINTER 22 160 128

# 2. The mouse moves, still on entry 12, and a click closes the field and
# opens that app: no search runs
@GOTO 22.5 168 128
@CLICK 23.5
@APPROW 28 12 SPLIST 1
snap 28

# Back: the list again, with no search text and entry 12 still selected
key 29 b
@ROWSEL 33 12 SPLIST 1
@TEXT 33 27 1 0        

# 3. S, text, and the mouse moves onto Category (row 30) and clicks: the field
# closes and the picker opens
key 34 s
key 35 zebra
@GOTO 36.5 110 244
@TEXT 37.5 27 9 4 zebra
@CLICK 38.5
@CATS 43 0
@BUTTONS 43 b picker
@TEXT 43 27 1 0        
snap 43

# A click on a category row picks it: Games, as the status line says
@GOTOCAT 43.5 games
@CLICK 45
@ROWS 50 SPCAT games 1
@BUTTONS 50 schq
snap 50

# A click on Category opens the picker, and a click on Back (in its place)
# leaves it as it was
@GOTO 50.5 110 244
@CLICK 52
@CATS 55.5 0
@CLICK 56
@ROWS 60 SPCAT games 1

# Category again, and a click on All takes the category off
@CLICK 60.5
@CATS 64 0
@GOTOCAT 64.5 all
@CLICK 66
@ROWS 70.5 SPLIST 1

# 4. S, text, and the mouse moves onto Quit and clicks: .spun quits and BASIC
# goes on
key 71 s
key 72 zebra
@GOTO 73.5 180 244
@TEXT 75 27 9 4 zebra
@CLICK 75.5
key 80 {SPACE}
screen 86 SPUNGUIDONE

snap 86
